  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shiraka Training Programme and E-Government 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">E-government and digitization are important developments for every field of government. In this annual course, civil servants are invited to share and further develop their knowledge and skills on these topics, to enable them to lead and inspire the implementation and modernization of e-government in their home countries. The course also aims to strengthen participants ties with the Netherlands and the Dutch government, especially between Dutch civil servants and their counterparts in the target countries.</narrative>
  </description>
